stream
BT /F2 10 Tf 50 750 Td (Syllora Academic Repository | Course: CS301 Operating Systems) Tj 400 0 Td (Page 4 of 5) Tj -400 -25 Td /F2 16 Tf (CS301: CS301 Lecture Slides: Concurrency & Deadlocks) Tj 0 -30 Td /F1 11 Tf 16 TL T* /F2 13 Tf (Slide 4: Real-world Deadlock in Multi-tier Storage) Tj /F1 11 Tf T* (Deadlocks are not merely theoretical; they routinely occur in database transaction managers) Tj T* (and distributed storage arrays with two-phase locking protocols.) Tj T* (Graph cycle detection is actively implemented in PostgreSQL and MySQL InnoDB engines.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
